<app-nav title="编辑资料" back="{{true}}" backLabel="{{backLabel || '返回我的'}}" bindback="back" />
<view class="page personal-page profile-page {{pendingSave ? 'has-pending-save' : ''}}">
  <view wx:if="{{loading && !profile}}" class="status">正在读取资料…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="inline-error" role="alert"><view>{{error}}</view><button hover-class="none" wx:if="{{conflict || !profile}}" class="secondary" bindtap="reload">重新载入资料</button></view>
  <form wx:if="{{profile}}" bindsubmit="save">
    <view class="avatar-editor">
      <view class="avatar-preview">
        <image wx:if="{{avatarPreview}}" class="profile-avatar large" src="{{avatarPreview}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view wx:else class="profile-avatar large avatar-fallback">{{initial}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="nickname-editor">
        <view wx:if="{{editingNickname}}" class="nickname-input-row">
          <input id="profile-nickname" class="input nickname-input {{nicknameError ? 'is-invalid' : ''}}" name="nickname" type="nickname" maxlength="16" value="{{nickname}}" focus="{{editingNickname}}" bindinput="inputName" bindblur="finishNicknameEdit" bindconfirm="finishNicknameEdit" bindkeyboardheightchange="keyboardHeightChange" confirm-type="done" cursor-spacing="24" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave}}" placeholder="输入1–16个字符" aria-label="个人昵称，1至16个字符" />
          <button hover-class="none" class="nickname-done" bindtap="finishNicknameEdit" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave}}">完成</button>
        </view>
        <button wx:else hover-class="none" class="nickname-display" bindtap="editNickname" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave}}" aria-label="{{'修改个人昵称，当前昵称：' + nickname}}">
          <text class="nickname-text">{{nickname}}</text>
          <image class="nickname-edit-icon" src="/assets/edit.svg" aria-hidden="{{true}}" />
        </button>
        <view wx:if="{{nicknameError}}" class="nickname-error" role="alert">{{nicknameError}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{canUpload}}" class="custom-avatar-editor">
      <view class="custom-avatar-actions">
        <button hover-class="none" class="secondary custom-avatar-button" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseCustomAvatar" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave || uploadBusy}}" aria-label="上传自己的头像图片">{{uploadStatus ? '重新选择图片' : '上传自己的图片'}}</button>
        <button wx:if="{{uploadStatus}}" hover-class="none" class="custom-avatar-cancel" bindtap="cancelCustomAvatar" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave}}">取消更换</button>
      </view>
      <view class="small muted avatar-upload-hint">JPG / PNG，最大2MB；审核通过后点击保存生效。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{uploadStatus === 'uploading'}}" class="small avatar-upload-status" role="status">{{uploadProgress < 100 ? '正在上传 ' + uploadProgress + '%' : '正在处理图片…'}}</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{uploadStatus === 'pending' || uploadStatus === 'processing'}}" class="small avatar-upload-status" role="status">图片正在审核，当前头像继续使用。</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{uploadStatus === 'approved'}}" class="small avatar-upload-status" role="status">审核通过，点击保存资料即可使用。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{uploadError}}" class="avatar-upload-error" role="alert">{{uploadError}}</view>
      <button wx:if="{{uploadError && uploadStatus !== 'rejected'}}" hover-class="none" class="secondary custom-avatar-retry" bindtap="retryAvatarUpload" disabled="{{uploadBusy || busy || pendingSave}}">{{uploadStatus === 'pending' || uploadStatus === 'processing' ? '继续检查审核结果' : '重试上传'}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="avatar-library">
      <view class="field-title">选择头像</view>
      <view class="avatar-styles" role="group" aria-label="头像风格">
        <button wx:for="{{avatarStyles}}" wx:key="id" hover-class="none" class="avatar-style {{avatarStyle === item.id ? 'is-active' : ''}}" data-style="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseAvatarStyle" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave}}" aria-label="{{item.label + '，' + item.count + '款头像'}}" aria-pressed="{{avatarStyle === item.id}}">{{item.shortLabel}}</button>
      </view>
      <view class="avatar-grid">
        <button wx:for="{{visibleAvatars}}" wx:key="id" hover-class="none" class="avatar-option {{selectedAvatar === item.id ? 'is-selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseBuiltinAvatar" disabled="{{busy || pendingSave}}" aria-label="{{item.label}}{{selectedAvatar === item.id ? '，已选择' : ''}}" aria-pressed="{{selectedAvatar === item.id}}">
          <image class="avatar-option-image" src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="{{true}}" aria-hidden="{{true}}" />
          <text wx:if="{{selectedAvatar === item.id}}" class="avatar-option-selected" aria-hidden="{{true}}">✓</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!keyboardHeight}}" class="profile-save-bar">
      <view class="profile-save-content">
        <view wx:if="{{pendingSave && !busy}}" class="profile-save-hint small muted">保存结果尚未确认，请重试保存。</view>
        <button hover-class="none" class="primary profile-save" form-type="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{loading || busy || conflict || uploadStatus === 'uploading' || uploadStatus === 'pending' || uploadStatus === 'processing' || uploadStatus === 'failed' || uploadStatus === 'rejected'}}">{{busy ? '正在保存…' : (pendingSave ? '重试保存' : '保存资料')}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </form>
</view>
